    "detailed_description": "In this retro platformer, the goal is simple. <strong>Get to the exit door.</strong> Of course, it's never just that simple\u2026<br><br>You begin the game trapped in prison.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768080/extras/f4b46c5f572c1ab1b18b1bbc86cead6b.avif?t=1712307912\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><br>First you must break out, which is a task in itself \u2013\u00a0but breaking out of prison is never easy, unless you're Stallone! But it's simple once you know how\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768080/extras/c2001bd41edc5f11d6255d1a7da37117.avif?t=1712307912\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><br>After that, you'll make your way into a complex network of levels which you must traverse.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768080/extras/4d93f6a5f0fe6a0bc665ddb89c748e1a.avif?t=1712307912\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><br>The path from door to door becomes increasingly difficult.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768080/extras/cada6f6486e17f98d9e53120678fa8af.avif?t=1712307912\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><br>Ingenious traps \u2013 each one designed to kill you \u2013\u00a0litter your pathway. Some you can simply jump over. Others you can crouch underneath. However, there are those where you'll need luck, skill and speed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768080/extras/4fb6c78208a3f217f51683c380e31aae.avif?t=1712307912\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><br>And two questions remain. Are you really free? Indeed, who's the one who's really trapped\u2026?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768080/extras/2a5215c931f9266f96ece3a633f03588.avif?t=1712307912\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><br>Maybe you'll choose to stay a prisoner and escape faster and faster each time. Perhaps even death might be out of the quesiton\u2026",
    "about_the_game": "In this retro platformer, the goal is simple. <strong>Get to the exit door.</strong> Of course, it's never just that simple\u2026<br><br>You begin the game trapped in prison.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768080/extras/f4b46c5f572c1ab1b18b1bbc86cead6b.avif?t=1712307912\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><br>First you must break out, which is a task in itself \u2013\u00a0but breaking out of prison is never easy, unless you're Stallone! But it's simple once you know how\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768080/extras/c2001bd41edc5f11d6255d1a7da37117.avif?t=1712307912\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><br>After that, you'll make your way into a complex network of levels which you must traverse.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768080/extras/4d93f6a5f0fe6a0bc665ddb89c748e1a.avif?t=1712307912\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><br>The path from door to door becomes increasingly difficult.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768080/extras/cada6f6486e17f98d9e53120678fa8af.avif?t=1712307912\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><br>Ingenious traps \u2013 each one designed to kill you \u2013\u00a0litter your pathway. Some you can simply jump over. Others you can crouch underneath. However, there are those where you'll need luck, skill and speed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768080/extras/4fb6c78208a3f217f51683c380e31aae.avif?t=1712307912\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><br>And two questions remain. Are you really free? Indeed, who's the one who's really trapped\